,"web":{"athletes":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/16737/mike-evans"}}}}},{"id":696302,"type":"contributor","guid":"138f8e60-058f-3c5a-9eb4-7dcd2f50d36d","description":"Nick Wagoner","slug":"nick-wagoner","contributor":{"id":2313,"description":"Nick Wagoner"}}],"keywords":["NFL","San Francisco 49ers","news","Nick Bosa","Christian McCaffrey","Mike Evans","Nick Wagoner"],"story":"<p>SANTA CLARA, Calif. -- The <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"985a261f-296c-c95c-32a5-addc4df75001\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/sf/san-francisco-49ers\">San Francisco 49ers</a> will welcome defensive end <a data-player-guid=\"6a5ec871-ae65-1fde-4664-f513284ad1ba\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4040605/nick-bosa\">Nick Bosa</a> (calf) and running back <a data-player-guid=\"db08ac19-dbd9-a776-5885-de1fe6830bc2\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/3117251/christian-mccaffrey\">Christian McCaffrey</a> (hamstring) back from injury Sunday while receiver <a data-player-guid=\"5073fc58-91c1-4e3d-826d-af754f9f40c7\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/16737/mike-evans\">Mike Evans</a> will miss his second consecutive game because of Achilles tendinitis.</p>\n<p>Bosa, who has been out since before a Week 3 game against <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"8fc7b962-95e1-3cb8-6a7d-b499de9ad546\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/ari/arizona-cardinals\">Arizona Cardinals</a>, returned to practice this week and participated in some capacity for all three sessions this week. He has no injury designation for Sunday against the <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"b18540eb-6f2b-534c-e7f9-9bd930518da9\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/lv/las-vegas-raiders\">Las Vegas Raiders</a> and is good to go.</p>\n<p>\"I feel great,\" Bosa said. \"Bye week was a good extra week for me and I'm ready to go.\"</p>\n<p>Likewise, McCaffrey also does not have an injury designation after suffering a minor hamstring strain in Week 7 against the <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"49fd392a-86fe-4df3-1b77-9bbfa18b2ad5\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/atl/atlanta-falcons\">Atlanta Falcons</a>. McCaffrey did not practice Wednesday but participated on Thursday and Friday on his way to being cleared.</p>\n<p><alsosee></p>\n<p>Much like Bosa, McCaffrey said the Week 8 bye helped his recovery so he would not miss any time.</p>\n<p>\"It wasn't too bad,\" McCaffrey said. \"I think having the bye week was awesome, but I feel great.\"</p>\n<p>Evans, meanwhile, continues to deal with Achilles tendinitis that flared up in a Week 6 win against the <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"fbeaf73e-6d6c-cca4-0809-713d9d741f90\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/wsh/washington-commanders\">Washington Commanders</a>. He did not play against the Falcons and then had the bye week to continue recovering.</p>\n<p>Although Evans has made \"a lot of progress,\" according to coach Kyle Shanahan, the Niners don't want to risk pushing him too hard too soon so his injury doesn't get worse.</p>\n<p>\"I think you learn from the history,\" general manager John Lynch told KNBR radio in San Francisco on Thursday. \"Christian had this situation and every player is different, every situation is different but you don't want it to become something that really lingers. So, we're trying to knock it out such that when he comes back, we give him the best chance to stay back.\"</p>\n<p>In addition to Evans, the Niners ruled out fellow wideouts <a data-player-guid=\"7f300cb7-f0a1-a43a-d0b0-f8a57bf04eb3\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/3126486/deebo-samuel-sr\">Deebo Samuel Sr</a>. (hamstring) and <a data-player-guid=\"0c22d637-c0d7-6bac-7333-dc3a992bdc0d\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/3895856/christian-kirk\">Christian Kirk</a> (knee) for Sunday. Kirk injured his meniscus in practice Wednesday. It's unclear whether Kirk will need surgery, Shanahan said.</p>\n<p>In better receiver news, Shanahan said it's likely the team will activate <a data-player-guid=\"31f80c0b-02ca-cf2f-2fc3-669604f71430\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/3043116/demarcus-robinson\">Demarcus Robinson</a> (ankle) from injured reserve to play against the Raiders. That would leave a group of Robinson, <a data-player-guid=\"280e4563-f82e-37a3-a9ea-fd1a0232346f\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4431466/jordan-watkins\">Jordan Watkins</a>, <a data-player-guid=\"788f8622-3564-9d11-752d-1265e7c75c91\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4575665/jacob-cowing\">Jacob Cowing</a>, <a data-player-guid=\"e6108d57-ec3b-2e99-7260-781af58bb13c\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/16731/brandin-cooks\">Brandin Cooks</a> and, likely, <a data-player-guid=\"da675704-aeba-bd90-bbc6-03f72e44f6bd\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/3047876/khadarel-hodge\">KhaDarel Hodge</a> being elevated from the practice squad, as the team's receivers for Sunday.</p>\n<p>The 49ers listed Robinson, cornerback <a data-player-guid=\"1b718dbd-81cd-4fc2-ad85-60091ad65be4\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4240542/nate-hobbs\">Nate Hobbs</a> (adductor), safety <a data-player-guid=\"4c4be385-852d-a7b0-5953-9363be58fd36\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/3057524/siran-neal\">Siran Neal</a> (knee, foot) and cornerback <a data-player-guid=\"ae80113a-905c-37f7-9a7d-040f343a68c6\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4565200/upton-stout\">Upton Stout</a> (shoulder) as questionable for Sunday. Shanahan said it remains up in the air on whether they'll activate Hobbs from injured reserve this week.</p>\n\n\n\n\n","allowAMP":true,"allowAds":true,"allowComments":true,"allowCommerce":true,"allowContentReactions":false,"allowSearch":true,"byline":"Nick Wagoner","isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"api":{"self":{"href":"https://content.core.api.espn.com/v1/sports/news/50402463"}},"app":{"sportscenter":{"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showStory?uid=50402463"}},"mobile":{"href":"http://m.espn.go.com/nfl/story?storyId=50402463"},"web":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50402463/nick-bosa-back-christian-mccaffrey-good-go-niners"}},"premium":false},{"id":50402162,"nowId":"1-50402162","contentKey":"50402162-1-5-1","dataSourceIdentifier":"b9e55f2d935e8","publishedkey":"50402162","type":"HeadlineNews","feedDisplayType":"Default","headline":"Giants' Cam Skattebo doubtful vs. Eagles; Malik Nabers 'full go'","description":"Giants running back Cam Skattebo is unlikely to play against the Eagles on Sunday, but receiver Malik Nabers is expected to be a \"full go\" without limitations.","title":"Giants' Cam Skattebo doubtful vs. Eagles; Nabers 'full go'","linkText":"Giants' Skattebo doubtful vs. Eagles; Nabers expected to be 'full go'","categorized":"2026-11-06T22:38:03Z","originallyPosted":"2026-11-06T22:09:46Z","lastModified":"2026-11-06T22:38:03Z","published":"2026-11-06T22:38:03Z","root":"nfl","section":"NFL","images":[{"dataSourceIdentifier":"4a9fdf1b4fc9f","id":50104711,"type":"header","name":"Skattebo Giants Cardinals_261004 [1296x729]","caption":"Cam Skattebo and the New York Giants are 3-1 after beating the Arizona Cardinals on Sunday.","alt":"Cam Skattebo and the New York Giants are 3-1 after beating the Arizona Cardinals on Sunday.","credit":"Getty Images","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/1004/r1726061_1296x729_16-9.jpg"}],"related":[{"id":50360077,"dataSourceIdentifier":"cd9560ddec919","publishedkey":"50360077","type":"Story","headline":"What 18 contenders should do at the NFL trade deadline: Who could get aggressive?","title":"What 18 contenders should do at the 2026 NFL trade deadline","linkText":"Which NFL teams should make trades before the deadline? What Barnwell expects for 18 contenders","images":[{"dataSourceIdentifier":"5d44d7324ce1f","id":50381995,"type":"header","name":"John Harbaugh [608x342]","credit":"AP Photo/Gerald Herbert","height":342,"width":608,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/1104/r1741192_608x342_16-9.jpg"}],"byline":"Bill Barnwell","isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"api":{"self":{"href":"https://content.core.api.espn.com/v1/sports/news/50360077"}},"app":{"sportscenter":{"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showStory?uid=50360077"}},"mobile":{"href":"http://m.espn.go.com/nfl/story?storyId=50360077"},"web":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50360077/2026-nfl-trade-deadline-contenders-activity-add-subtract"}},"premium":false},{"id":50381724,"dataSourceIdentifier":"7dbef1d10181d","publishedkey":"50381724","type":"Story","headline":"NFL Week 9 preview: Picks, predictions, schedule, betting odds, fantasy tips","title":"NFL Week 9 picks, predictions, schedule, odds, fantasy tips","linkText":"Our guide to every NFL Week 9 game: Matchup previews, predictions, picks and nuggets","images":[{"dataSourceIdentifier":"0ed66ea2f85ac","id":50392263,"type":"header","name":"Josh Allen [608x342]","caption":"Bills quarterback Josn Allen last faced the Vikings on Nov. 22, 2022,","credit":"Timothy T Ludwig/Getty Images","height":342,"width":608,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/1106/r1741717_2_608x342_16-9.jpg"}],"byline":"NFL Nation, Pamela Maldonado, Eric Moody and Seth Walder","isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"api":{"self":{"href":"https://content.core.api.espn.com/v1/sports/news/50381724"}},"app":{"sportscenter":{"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showStory?uid=50381724"}},"mobile":{"href":"http://m.espn.go.com/nfl/story?storyId=50381724"},"web":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50381724/week-9-picks-predictions-schedule-fantasy-odds-2026"}},"premium":false},{"id":50043542,"dataSourceIdentifier":"768d0a1ed9c4b","publishedkey":"50043542","type":"Story","headline":"NFL trade deadline grades: Deals for Jacoby Brissett, Jeffery Simmons, more","title":"NFL trade deadline grades: Jacoby Brissett, Jeffery Simmons","linkText":"Grading NFL deadline trades: Sizing up eight trades -- including Brissett to Baltimore","images":[{"dataSourceIdentifier":"3e316dba3e0da","id":50400616,"type":"header","name":"Jacoby Brissett [608x342]","credit":"Kevin Jairaj-Imagn Images","height":342,"width":608,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/1106/r1742051_608x342_16-9.jpg"}],"byline":"Ben Solak and Seth Walder","isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"api":{"self":{"href":"https://content.core.api.espn.com/v1/sports/news/50043542"}},"app":{"sportscenter":{"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showStory?uid=50043542"}},"mobile":{"href":"http://m.espn.go.com/nfl/story?storyId=50043542"},"web":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50043542/2026-trade-deadline-grades-latest-best-worst-deals"}},"premium":false}],"categories":[{"id":450385,"type":"athlete","uid":"s:20~l:28~a:4696981","guid":"0be760c4-3eb7-338a-9b0b-20de5895543c","description":"Cam Skattebo","sportId":28,"athleteId":4696981,"athlete":{"id":4696981,"description":"Cam Skattebo","links":{"mobile":{"athletes":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4696981/cam-skattebo"}},"web":{"athletes":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4696981/cam-skattebo"}}}}},{"id":489486,"type":"athlete","uid":"s:20~l:28~a:4595348","guid":"44a2174b-1d11-3acf-8e75-fe0c13db47a6","description":"Malik Nabers","sportId":28,"athleteId":4595348,"athlete":{"id":4595348,"description":"Malik Nabers","links":{"mobile":{"athletes":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4595348/malik-nabers"}},"web":{"athletes":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4595348/malik-nabers"}}}}},{"id":1352,"type":"team","uid":"s:20~l:28~t:19","guid":"378600ea-2397-8364-8399-b7c1606a49a7","description":"New York Giants","sportId":28,"teamId":19,"team":{"id":19,"description":"New York Giants","abbreviation":"NYG","shortDisplayName":"Giants","links":{"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/nyg/new-york-giants"}},"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/nyg/new-york-giants"}}}}},{"id":9572,"type":"league","uid":"s:20~l:28","guid":"ad4c3bd2-ddb6-3f8c-8abf-744855a08fa4","description":"NFL","sportId":28,"leagueId":28,"league":{"id":28,"description":"NFL","abbreviation":"NFL","links":{"mobile":{"leagues":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/"}},"web":{"leagues":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/"}}}}},{"id":696298,"type":"contributor","guid":"b8dd259e-f5fa-3124-8d1c-5c0caf40d38f","description":"Jordan Raanan","slug":"jordan-raanan","contributor":{"id":2721,"description":"Jordan Raanan"}}],"keywords":["Cam Skattebo","Malik Nabers","New York Giants","NFL","Jordan Raanan"],"story":"<p>EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. -- <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"378600ea-2397-8364-8399-b7c1606a49a7\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/nyg/new-york-giants\">New York Giants</a> running back <a data-player-guid=\"0be760c4-3eb7-338a-9b0b-20de5895543c\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4696981/cam-skattebo\">Cam Skattebo</a> is unlikely to play on the road against the <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"d1a9b001-1df7-fbd7-ae4c-6ca7065286ec\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/phi/philadelphia-eagles\">Philadelphia Eagles</a> on Sunday, but wide receiver <a data-player-guid=\"44a2174b-1d11-3acf-8e75-fe0c13db47a6\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4595348/malik-nabers\">Malik Nabers</a> is expected to be a \"full go\" without limitations, coach John Harbaugh said Friday.</p>\n<p>Skattebo, who is listed as doubtful for Sunday's game, injured his hamstring in overtime at the <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"595690b3-2161-4913-a7a7-814af2fd2621\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/hou/houston-texans\">Houston Texans</a> on Oct. 25. He didn't practice this week despite having had a bye week to recover.</p>\n<p>While it doesn't look good for Sunday, Harbaugh didn't want to close the door completely.</p>\n<p>\"Yeah, let's keep it open,\" he said. \"Let's keep it open, let's see what happens.\"</p>\n<p><alsosee></p>\n<p>Skattebo leads the Giants with 418 yards rushing on 98 carries. No other player on the team has 100 yards rushing this season.</p>\n<p>Nabers, who missed practice Thursday because of his right knee, practiced Friday without an injury designation and is expected to play without any limitations.</p>\n<p>\"He practiced fully. He was full participation. It's not an issue,\" Harbaugh said. \"He'll be full go for the game.\"</p>\n<p>Nabers has played all seven games for New York this season after suffering a serious knee injury last season. He leads the team with 48 catches for 605 yards and is looking for his fifth straight 100-yard game Sunday against the Eagles.</p>\n<p>The Giants (4-2-1) are looking for their first win at Lincoln Financial Field since 2013. Last season, Skattebo suffered a fractured ankle in Philadelphia.</p>\n<p>His absence would leave the Giants short-handed at running back. <a data-player-guid=\"6e8f4728-f347-ab07-9112-a1528d0162d7\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4040761/devin-singletary\">Devin Singletary</a>, who rushed for the game-winning 30-yard touchdown in Houston after being inactive for several games earlier this season, is expected to be the primary back Sunday. Newcomer <a data-player-guid=\"a6790fee-7e0c-32f3-9003-9d1819c7bbaf\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4691889/greg-desrosiers-jr\">Greg Desrosiers Jr</a>. and <a data-player-guid=\"695ff537-e84e-3fff-8706-affe370e5939\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4431562/phil-mafah\">Phil Mafah</a> are other likely options.</p>\n<p><a data-player-guid=\"299f83a3-54ea-c2bc-743a-e84fe4e1de18\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4360516/tyrone-tracy-jr\">Tyrone Tracy Jr</a>. was placed on injured reserve last week with a hamstring injury.</p>\n<p>Desrosiers was signed off the <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"84caf62b-c753-71ea-a787-44fd224a4294\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/lac/los-angeles-chargers\">Los Angeles Chargers</a>' practice squad to take Tracy's place last week. He's set to play in his first career game. Mafah has appeared in one game and has five career carries, which came for the <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"b0fc8fb7-9dbe-e574-9008-6f0ee7c6b234\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/_/name/dal/dallas-cowboys\">Dallas Cowboys</a> against the Giants in Week 18 last season.</p>\n\n\n\n\n","allowAMP":true,"allowAds":true,"allowComments":true,"allowCommerce":true,"allowContentReactions":true,"allowSearch":true,"byline":"Jordan Raanan","isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"api":{"self":{"href":"https://content.core.api.espn.com/v1/sports/news/50402162"}},"app":{"sportscenter":{"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showStory?uid=50402162"}},"mobile":{"href":"http://m.espn.go.com/nfl/story?storyId=50402162"},"web":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50402162/giants-cam-skattebo-doubtful-vs-eagles-nabers-full-go"}},"premium":false},{"id":50401690,"nowId":"1-50401690","contentKey":"50401690-1-5-1","dataSourceIdentifier":"b46f8e3dd6f07","publishedkey":"50401690","type":"HeadlineNews","feedDisplayType":"Default","headline":"Alabama's Ryan Coleman-Williams among trio to return vs. LSU","description":"Alabama will get a trio of injured starters -- WR Ryan Coleman-Williams, center Racin Delgatty and DT Terrance Green -- back for Saturday's game at LSU.","title":"Alabama's Ryan Coleman-Williams among trio to return vs. LSU","linkText":"Coleman-Williams among Tide trio returning for pivotal matchup vs. LSU","categorized":"2026-11-06T21:33:07Z","originallyPosted":"2026-11-06T20:48:35Z","lastModified":"2026-11-06T21:33:06Z","published":"2026-11-06T21:33:06Z","root":"ncf","section":"College Football","images":[{"dataSourceIdentifier":"6d3cf965d493e","id":50359553,"type":"header","name":"alabama [1296x729] - Copy 20261102","caption":"Wide receiver Ryan Coleman-Williams of Alabama avoids the tackle of defensive back Kamaurri McKinley of East Carolina after a reception during the first half of a game at Bryant Denny Stadium on Sept. 5, 2026.","credit":"Butch Dill/Getty Images","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0905/r1711925_1296x729_16-9.jpg"},{"typ